title: TutorialQuest
---
Guide: Hello, i'm glad you have woken up. For a moment I thought you wouldn't wake up. 
-> What happened to me?
    Guide: I have no idea, I found you unconcious in the forest and decided to bring you to my cabin.
-> Do you have any quests for me?
    Guide: Don't be so hasty, you should rest a bit. Here eat this manaherb.
    <<give_item manaherb 1>> 
Guide:Safe travels.
===